  "description": "GIDRAO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H84 Eu4 N12 O12,5.2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu2A (Eu) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.885-3.911 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.32-110.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C96H94.4Eu4N12O17.2.",
